@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Supported Sites";
}
<div class="container py-5">
    <h1 class="h3 mb-3">Supported sites</h1>
    <p class="text-secondary mb-4">
        MediaGrab only supports sources with a compliant, authorized provider implementation. This list grows
        deliberately - never by adding a scraper that violates a platform's terms of service.
    </p>
    <div class="mg-card p-4">
        <h2 class="h6">Direct file links</h2>
        <p class="small text-secondary mb-0">Publicly accessible URLs pointing directly at a file (no login/paywall/DRM).</p>
    </div>
    <p class="text-secondary small mt-4">More providers will be added in future phases as authorized integrations become available.</p>
</div>
